 {id:'military_claude',name:'Military Claude',index:17,hp:540,speed:0,damage:45,color:'#8e9870',variant:true,anchored:true,summoned:true,convertible:false,ability:'military',skills:[L('宪章·终审','Final Clause','憲章・最終裁定'),L('战术驻防','Tactical Garrison','戦術駐屯')],desc:L('Trump 部署的军用 Claude，无法被策反，每路全场最多一位，驻守右侧，使用三星 Claude 的战斗效果：每 2 秒射出 63 伤害普攻；每 2.3 秒锁定本路最近目标及其周围 125 范围内的目标，0.65 秒后各造成 45 伤害并剥除护盾，可波及邻路。无 Harness 效果，不会策反 LLM。Trump 换路时与其交换位置。','Cannot be converted; at most one per lane globally. Trump’s stationary right-edge garrison, using three-star Claude combat: a 63-damage basic shot every 2s; every 2.3s marks the nearest target in its lane and others within 125px, including adjacent lanes. After 0.65s, deals 45 damage each and strips shields. No Harness or conversion. Swaps positions with Trump when he changes to its lane.','転向不可・全体で各レーン最大1体。Trumpが右端へ配備。三つ星Claudeと同じ戦闘効果：2秒ごとに通常攻撃63、2.3秒ごとに同レーンの最寄り対象と周囲125以内をマークし、0.65秒後各45ダメージと盾解除。隣接レーンも対象。Harness・転向効果なし。Trumpのレーン変更時に位置を交換。')}
